            "path": "docs/guides/harness-instance-context-layout.md",
            "sha256": "5c8cc6928fbe1a8eb96c8d7d8dd173ab9fa2f864cbbfb18b345bc0c9c96f569f"
          }
        ],
        "symbols": [],
        "text": "Prepare a scoped objective, exact input and output contracts, budget and allowed effects. Keep host credentials and acceptance records outside model-editable context. Materialize only selected revisions into paths the chosen harness version supports. Inspect inherited user and repository instructions, disabled discovery and truncation. File placement alone does not prove native loading, execution or task benefit.",
        "title": "Review a harness briefing and its native loading evidence"
      }
    },
    {
