        "text": "The recorded owner direction keeps model endpoints operated by the customer or provider. Loop Engine accepts supported endpoint and credential references; it does not need to own or launch every model server. Preserve selectable decision and building providers. Availability and quality need exact-route evidence, and a missing credential must remain an explicit unavailable result.",
